<title>USA: Fort Collins, Colo., bonds free to trade.</title>
<headline>Fort Collins, Colo., bonds free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>City of Fort Collins, Colorado</p>
<p>RE: $13,800,000</p>
<p>WASTEWATER UTILITY ENTERPRISE</p>
<p>SEWER REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS SERIES 1996A</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade. A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>Piper, Jaffray Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
